<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Shout</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>shout &lt;words to shout&gt;
</pre>
<p>When you shout, everyone in the game hears you, and what you shout is also seen 
on Valhalla's Discord. You can shout from level 5, and each shout takes some 
endurance.
</p><p>Monsters shout too, but only the players in the monster's own area hear them, so a 
town crier or a hunting beast is heard nearby and not all over the game. A few 
announce a player's great deed, such as finishing a quest, and those are heard 
everywhere.
</p><p><b>Public communications</b>
</p><p>We insist that the public channels, like shout and newbie, remain friendly and 
clean of profanity. This in no way hinders you from making a total jerk out of 
yourself in private. A swear word in a shout costs you the right to shout for an 
hour, at once.
</p><p>We also insist that there be no advertising for other muds, games, or your own 
private favourite web page in the public channels or on the boards.
</p><p>Offenders of these rules lose the ability to use their communication channels 
for a time decided by the offence and by the person or program that catches 
them. If you feel you need full freedom to speak, use say or tell.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
